			description: [
				"By collecting DNA you can place this inside of a mob cage. Then you need to add a certain block shown in JEI. This will then start to generate mob drops based on the mob inside"
				"Example. Hit a cow to get its DNA in a DNA sampler, the add a wheat block to the cage and right click the DNA in. You will se that it starts to make loot. Right click to harvest"
